    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ever wondered what it'd be like if money grew on trees?\u00a0\ud83d\udcb8\ud83c\udf33<br><strong>An incremental-minimalist clicker farming game about growing your own farm full of money trees!</strong>  <br><strong>Click. Water. Grow. Harvest. Explore. Upgrade. Profit.</strong><br><strong>Online co-op supported!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794300/extras/ff1cbe56a715c4ed2cd77c9489732728.poster.avif?t=1755783273\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794300/extras/ff1cbe56a715c4ed2cd77c9489732728.webm?t=1755783273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794300/extras/ff1cbe56a715c4ed2cd77c9489732728.mp4?t=1755783273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40+ trees to grow, start small and expand to a sprawling money tree farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to harvest money from trees (because everybody knows that money does indeed grow on trees)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your garden by building new crop plots and trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore to find chests and gold bars to unlock new and bigger trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water your crops for faster growth or wait for time to grow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools and equipment to farm and explore even faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build greenhouses and watering systems to speed up growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tree rarities: Common, Uncommon, Rare, Legendary, Mythical, Divine, Unbelievable</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ever wondered what it'd be like if money grew on trees?\u00a0\ud83d\udcb8\ud83c\udf33<br><strong>An incremental-minimalist clicker farming game about growing your own farm full of money trees!</strong>  <br><strong>Click. Water. Grow. Harvest. Explore. Upgrade. Profit.</strong><br><strong>Online co-op supported!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794300/extras/ff1cbe56a715c4ed2cd77c9489732728.poster.avif?t=1755783273\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794300/extras/ff1cbe56a715c4ed2cd77c9489732728.webm?t=1755783273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794300/extras/ff1cbe56a715c4ed2cd77c9489732728.mp4?t=1755783273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40+ trees to grow, start small and expand to a sprawling money tree farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to harvest money from trees (because everybody knows that money does indeed grow on trees)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your garden by building new crop plots and trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore to find chests and gold bars to unlock new and bigger trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water your crops for faster growth or wait for time to grow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools and equipment to farm and explore even faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build greenhouses and watering systems to speed up growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tree rarities: Common, Uncommon, Rare, Legendary, Mythical, Divine, Unbelievable</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
